;    1: TDecorate(count=1, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=ひん, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    2: TDecorate(count=36, unk2=16755370, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    3: TDecorate(count=693, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=ＭＳ Ｐゴシック, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    4: TDecorate(count=4, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=ＭＳ Ｐゴシック, ruby=しがつようか, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    5: TDecorate(count=2, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=えっけん, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    6: TDecorate(count=2, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=とんざ, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    7: TDecorate(count=40, unk2=16755455, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
; Display conditions:
;    0: TWdCondition(count=1477, target=)
; Links:
;    0: TWdLink(count=1384, event=, unk3=)
;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\z50.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\サード\蔵本.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>The residents' disappearances had not happened only once.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Several times in the past, the green-eyed and the Goddess had brought the settlement to the <STYLE ID="1" RUBY="ひん">brink</STYLE> of disaster.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And to my astonishment, residents had gone missing as recently as about 10 years before.<PG>
I asked Mother to show me the letter that recorded what had happened at that time.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I also had her let me keep it among the storehouse's books.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I had it made part of the storehouse's books out of fear that the memory would fade, and so that the document would be passed down to later generations.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">Ko-san</STYLE> said:
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Is that connected to Droga?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I answered:
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Droga exists only here. So the proper course is to look for the cause in the things that exist only here.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In Mother's document there was a passage like this.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\町娘背景\書簡.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">'In the spring of the year after the mass disappearance, we noticed that dozens of unfamiliar cherry trees had appeared around the Arata settlement. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">They had suddenly appeared in places where, until the year before, there had been no sign of any tree at all. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">As if they had bloomed in full every year, the great cherry trees proudly flaunted their blossoms.'</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">'The number of cherry trees that suddenly appeared was about 30. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">By strange coincidence, this is nearly the same as the number of residents who disappeared.'</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">'We decided to cut one of the newly grown trees and study how it lives. We dug it up by the roots and replanted it within the settlement. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">As we did so, clothing and a skeleton came up, tangled in the roots. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">So it is true. These cherry trees grew suddenly, using the residents as a seedbed. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">This tree is no cherry tree at all. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">It is some other thing that looks just like a cherry.'</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">'Since ancient times, it is said, these cherry-tree-like things that suddenly appear have been called '</STYLE><STYLE ID="4" RUBY="しがつようか">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">.' </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">An eerie flower blooms in the month of death. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">The people of the Arata settlement, unless by accident or injury, almost without fail die in April. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">That is why it is the month of death.'</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">'Indeed, if we think of it this way, can we not solve nearly all the mysterious phenomena surrounding this Arata settlement? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Until now these inexplicable phenomena have been dismissed as curses or youkai, but this is an age when the Great Powers are pressing in on Japan and Westernization is expected to advance. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">It is time we broke free of this myth-mindedness and unraveled the mysteries of the Arata settlement realistically.'</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">'As one part of this, a representative will be sent from this Arata settlement to Tokyo. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">The representative will carry Droga and present it to the Emperor or to those who hold power. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">If the right person can be found, research with ample funds and facilities should be possible, but there is no knowing when the mystery of Droga will be solved―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Even if it takes 100 years, it ought to be unraveled across the generations.'</STYLE><PG>
It seemed Mother, too, had vaguely noticed a link between the disappearances and Droga.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That was why she had <STYLE ID="2">Ko-san</STYLE> carry Droga and seek an <STYLE ID="5" RUBY="えっけん">audience</STYLE> with the Emperor.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But the Emperor did not accept it, and the research into Droga came to a <STYLE ID="6" RUBY="とんざ">standstill</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Since I came in its place, I myself am carrying out that research.<PG>
I see. So it is 'Shigatsu Youka.'
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The 'Shigatsu Youka,' which looks just like a cherry, uses humans in some way, through the Droga made from its roots, to multiply its cherry trees.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
For a living thing, that makes sense.<PG>
But...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Why is it? Something does not sit right.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If it is suspicious, it is simply a matter of having the use of Droga stopped at once.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Mother has not done that...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家居間.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\立ち絵\晃\晃バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Ko-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">, is there a reason Mother permits the use of Droga?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Hmm... I can't really say without asking her..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"I suppose so..."</STYLE><PG>
It is not that I suspect Mother.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Mother permits Droga even though she has noticed that it is dangerous.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Most likely there is a reason she has no choice but to do so.
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
;---------------------------------------
; END DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------